<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/maratha-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Maratha%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Maratha Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Shivaji's son Sambhaji is executed during the long war with Aurangzeb</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/electoral-palatinate"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Electoral%20Palatinate.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Electoral Palatinate</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">French troops burn Heidelberg and Mannheim in the Nine Years' War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/enlightenment"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Enlightenment.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Enlightenment</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">John Locke publishes his Two Treatises of Government and An Essay Concerning Human Understanding</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/constitutional-monarchy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Constitutional%20monarchy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Constitutional monarchy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Bill of Rights forbids the English crown to suspend laws, levy taxes or keep a peacetime army without Parliament</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/peter-the-great"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Peter%20the%20Great.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Peter the Great</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Peter overthrows Sophia's regency and sends her to a convent</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/potosi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Potos%C3%AD.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Potosí</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The number of mitayos has dropped to about 4,000</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/juana-ines-de-la-cruz"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Juana%20In%C3%A9s%20de%20la%20Cruz.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Juana Inés de la Cruz</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Inundación castálida, her first volume of poetry, is published in Madrid</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/kangxi-emperor"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kangxi%20Emperor.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kangxi Emperor</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Treaty of Nerchinsk fixes a border between Russia and China</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/quakers"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Quakers.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Quakers</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Act of Toleration ends the official persecution of dissenters in England</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/puritans"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Puritans.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Puritans</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Toleration Act permits the licensing of Dissenting ministers and the building of chapels</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/libertarianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Libertarianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Libertarianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">John Locke’s Two Treatises of Government sets out the basis of liberal political theory</span></li></ul></section>
